{
 "id": "pad-mode",
 "order": 19,
 "name": "Pad Mode",
 "description": [
  "Hold TRACK + RETRIG: trig LEDs 1..6 show the pad tracks (blinking); TRACK + RETRIG + trig 1..6 turns a track into",
  "a pad track (per pattern). The sequencer does not play pad tracks. On an active pad track the trig keys play",
  "their steps (with p-locks, note, length and sample lock) instead of toggling them; hold a trig + turn a knob",
  "edits the step, FUNC + trig adds or clears it. The trig LEDs show the steps.",
  "MIDI: notes 36..51 on a pad track's channel play trigs 1..16 of the page shown, with velocity; the trig keys",
  "send these notes. Muted pad tracks stay silent. Playing a step: idea from drumkilla's trig-preview (MIT)."
 ],
 "device": "Model:Cycles OS 1.13 (also a Model:Samples running it)",
